standard deviation. EDIT: Added \[OpenCurlyQuote]Reverse\[CloseCurlyQuote] \
command so that autocorrelation increases as you go up the y-axis, instead of \
down; updated plot FrameTicks accordingly (6/4/25).\
\>", "Text",
